#: src/postulo/templates/server/plugins.html:25
#, draft
msgid ""
"A plugin's own file is checked against the checksum its catalogue signed. Its requirements are not: those are fetched from PyPI when it is installed, and are whatever is served that day. Trusting a plugin means trusting its list of requirements too. Postulo installs only built wheels, never a source package that would run its own code while installing, and records everything that arrived."
msgstr ""
"Caiff ffeil yr ategyn ei hun ei gwirio yn erbyn y swm gwirio a lofnododd ei gatalog. Nid felly ei gofynion: cânt eu nôl o PyPI pan gaiff ei osod, a beth bynnag a weinir y diwrnod hwnnw ydynt. Mae ymddiried mewn ategyn yn golygu ymddiried yn ei restr gofynion hefyd. Dim ond olwynion adeiledig y mae Postulo yn eu gosod, byth pecyn ffynhonnell a fyddai'n rhedeg ei god ei hun wrth osod, ac mae'n cofnodi popeth a gyrhaeddodd."

