#: src/postulo/core/server_forms.py:51
#, draft
msgid ""
"Yes: somebody who arrives through the identity provider is signed straight in, without being asked for a code as well. Say yes only if you know that provider checks identity at least as carefully as Postulo would. It never applies to a password sign-in, and it removes nobody's authenticator app. A passkey already counts on its own and needs no setting."
msgstr ""
"Ie: caiff rhywun sy'n cyrraedd drwy'r darparwr hunaniaeth ei fewngofnodi'n syth, heb ofyn am god hefyd. Dywedwch ie dim ond os ydych yn gwybod bod y darparwr hwnnw'n gwirio hunaniaeth o leiaf mor ofalus ag y byddai Postulo. Nid yw byth yn berthnasol i fewngofnodi â chyfrinair, ac nid yw'n tynnu ap dilysu neb. Mae allwedd fynediad eisoes yn cyfrif ar ei phen ei hun ac nid oes angen gosodiad arni."

